  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 2.48,
      "end": 6.48,
      "text": "This is Warren Buffett, one of the richest people in the world.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 6.48,
      "end": 9.48,
      "text": "Thanks to the company he runs, Berkshire Hathaway.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 9.48,
      "end": 13.48,
      "text": "Basically, it's a holding company that just owns a bunch of other companies,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.48,
      "end": 18.48,
      "text": "Geico, Dairy Queen, a huge railroad, as well as a lot of stock in other companies,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 18.48,
      "end": 20.48,
      "text": "like Apple and Coca-Cola.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 20.48,
      "end": 23.48,
      "text": "So when those companies do well and their stock goes up,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 23.48,
      "end": 26.48,
      "text": "Berkshire Hathaway stock goes up.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 26.48,
      "end": 29.48,
      "text": "When Buffett took over the company in 1965,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109249,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.014053
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 29.48,
      "end": 32.48,
      "text": "a single share was worth $19.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 32.48,
      "end": 36.48,
      "text": "Today, it's worth nearly half a million dollars.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 36.48,
      "end": 40.48,
      "text": "Buffett owns nearly 240,000 of these shares.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 40.48,
      "end": 43.48,
      "text": "This is where his wealth is.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 43.48,
      "end": 45.48,
      "text": "But as he's been known for pointing out,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 45.48,
      "end": 49.48,
      "text": "Warren Buffett still pays a lower tax rate than his secretary.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 49.48,
      "end": 53.48,
      "text": "She pays at twice the rate I pay. I think that's outrageous.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 53.48,
      "end": 56.48,
      "text": "That's because they pay different types of taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.053057,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003483
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 56.48,
      "end": 59.48,
      "text": "His secretary pays income taxes on her salary,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 59.48,
      "end": 63.48,
      "text": "but Buffett mainly pays capital gains taxes on his sold stock.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 63.48,
      "end": 66.48,
      "text": "And that's taxed at nearly half the rate.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 66.48,
      "end": 70.48,
      "text": "The wealthy are definitely under taxed.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 70.48,
      "end": 73.48,
      "text": "In the U.S., the disparity between the richest Americans",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 73.48,
      "end": 75.48,
      "text": "and everyone else has been growing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 75.48,
      "end": 77.48,
      "text": "And in the last 40 years,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 77.48,
      "end": 82.48,
      "text": "the after-tax income of the richest has risen more than 400 percent,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 82.48,
      "end": 85.48,
      "text": "while middle-class income has only risen 50.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.060633,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000779
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 85.48,
      "end": 88.48,
      "text": "The way these people make money is very different",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 88.48,
      "end": 90.48,
      "text": "than the way these people make money.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 90.48,
      "end": 96.39,
      "text": "And they're not taxed the same.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 96.39,
      "end": 100.39,
      "text": "I pay less in taxes than people that work for a living",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 100.39,
      "end": 102.39,
      "text": "and make as much money as I do.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 102.39,
      "end": 104.39,
      "text": "This is Morris. He used to work on Wall Street.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 104.39,
      "end": 108.39,
      "text": "Now he's retired and lives off his many stock market investments.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 108.39,
      "end": 114.39,
      "text": "I own stock in companies like Berkshire Hathaway and Amazon and Apple.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.066479,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000315
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 114.39,
      "end": 116.39,
      "text": "He's a pretty typical one-percenter,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 116.39,
      "end": 119.39,
      "text": "except that he spends his money advocating for rich people",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 119.39,
      "end": 121.39,
      "text": "like him to be taxed more.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 121.39,
      "end": 125.39,
      "text": "I want to live in a country filled with a middle class of people",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 125.39,
      "end": 129.39,
      "text": "who can all afford to shop in our businesses.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 129.39,
      "end": 131.39,
      "text": "Most people have a normal job.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 131.39,
      "end": 136.39,
      "text": "They get a paycheck and pay income tax, ranging from 10 to 37 percent.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 136.39,
      "end": 138.39,
      "text": "But people like Morris,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 138.39,
      "end": 141.39,
      "text": "they make a lot of their income from investments,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 141.39,
      "end": 143.39,
      "text": "generally stocks in real estate.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.051311,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000169
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 143.39,
      "end": 146.39,
      "text": "These investments are taxed as capital gains,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068206,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001206
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 146.39,
      "end": 151.39,
      "text": "and things like long-term stock have a maximum tax rate of just 20 percent.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068206,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001206
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 151.39,
      "end": 157.39,
      "text": "I sold some stock recently for $400,000,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068206,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001206
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 157.39,
      "end": 161.39,
      "text": "and my taxes on that have around $50,000.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068206,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001206
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 161.39,
      "end": 165.39,
      "text": "But that $50,000 is far less tax",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068206,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001206
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 165.39,
      "end": 169.39,
      "text": "than anyone who has a job making $400,000 a year would pay.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.068206,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001206
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 169.39,
      "end": 172.39,
      "text": "And most of his wealth, well, isn't even taxable.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 172.39,
      "end": 176.39,
      "text": "People like Morris or Buffett are worth so much money",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 176.39,
      "end": 178.39,
      "text": "because of the stock that they hold,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 178.39,
      "end": 181.39,
      "text": "but it's not tangible, spendable, taxable money.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 181.39,
      "end": 184.39,
      "text": "I can look at my stock portfolio and I can say,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 184.39,
      "end": 187.39,
      "text": "oh, you know, I made a million dollars this year,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 187.39,
      "end": 190.39,
      "text": "but it doesn't mean I have to pay anything in taxes,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 190.39,
      "end": 193.39,
      "text": "because our system is based on only paying taxes",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 193.39,
      "end": 195.39,
      "text": "when you actually sell something.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 195.39,
      "end": 198.39,
      "text": "Amazon's Jeff Bezos, the richest man in America,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.06996,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002472
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 198.39,
      "end": 200.39,
      "text": "thinks mostly to his Amazon stock,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 200.39,
      "end": 203.39,
      "text": "pays almost nothing in taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 203.39,
      "end": 206.39,
      "text": "We value his worth here, but it's never taxed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 206.39,
      "end": 209.39,
      "text": "unless it's turned into real money when he sells the stock,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 209.39,
      "end": 212.39,
      "text": "and it's taxed as a capital gain.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 212.39,
      "end": 216.39,
      "text": "This is one way billionaires are able to be technically worth so much money",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 216.39,
      "end": 219.39,
      "text": "but pay so little in taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 219.39,
      "end": 223.39,
      "text": "Some billionaires like Elon Musk are able to get loans against their stocks",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 223.39,
      "end": 225.39,
      "text": "and live off of that.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058629,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003273
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 225.39,
      "end": 228.39,
      "text": "They don't even need to sell the stock to turn it into spendable money.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 228.39,
      "end": 231.39,
      "text": "No sale, no taxes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 231.39,
      "end": 233.39,
      "text": "The fact is, if you're a billionaire,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 233.39,
      "end": 236.39,
      "text": "you don't need any income.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 236.39,
      "end": 238.39,
      "text": "There's also a big loophole in capital gains taxes",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 238.39,
      "end": 242.39,
      "text": "that the rich exploit called the stepped-up basis.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 242.39,
      "end": 245.39,
      "text": "If, hypothetically, Warren Buffett were to sell his stock,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 245.39,
      "end": 248.39,
      "text": "he'd have to pay capital gains taxes based on his profit,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 248.39,
      "end": 251.39,
      "text": "so the cost of the stock minus the original investment.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 251.39,
      "end": 254.39,
      "text": "But if he holds off selling his entire life,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.064631,
      "no_speech_prob": 4.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 254.39,
      "end": 258.39,
      "text": "when he dies, whoever inherits the stock and then sells it",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 258.39,
      "end": 262.39,
      "text": "would only have to pay taxes on what they earned after they inherited it,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.058594,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001032
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 262.39,
      "end": 266.39,
      "text": "leaving all those original gains untaxed.",
